# No keys are needed to run the app: crop data is in data/, insurance artifacts
# are in app/model/artifacts/, and three.js is bundled in web/assets/viewer/vendor/.
# If a teammate ever needs a key (for example to rebuild the data with the NASS API), copy this file to .env
# and put it there. .env is git-ignored; never commit real keys - the repository is public.
# NASS_API_KEY=
# Optional satellite/aerial maps use public USGS imagery and need browser internet
# access but no API key. Choose County outlines to use local geometry offline.
